---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Layanan Pengaduan & Aspirasi Warga Desa Timpik"
  description="Kanal resmi penyampaian aspirasi, saran pembangunan, dan pengaduan masyarakat Desa Timpik, Kecamatan Susukan, Kabupaten Semarang."
>
  <!-- Architectural Civic Header -->
  <section class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-950 via-blue-900 to-indigo-950 text-white border-b border-blue-800/40 pt-14 pb-12 sm:pt-16 sm:pb-14">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      <!-- Breadcrumb -->
      <nav class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-200 mb-5" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Beranda</a>
        <span class="text-blue-300">/</span>
        <span class="text-amber-400">Pengaduan Warga</span>
      </nav>

      <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-3">
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight text-white leading-tight">
          Layanan Pengaduan & Aspirasi Warga
        </h1>
        
        <p class="text-blue-100 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed pt-1">
          Pemerintah Desa Timpik membuka ruang bagi seluruh warga untuk menyampaikan aspirasi pembangunan jalan, irigasi sawah, bantuan sosial, atau kendala fasilitas umum lainnya.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Content Section -->
  <section class="py-12 sm:py-16 bg-slate-50 flex-grow">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-start">
        
        <!-- Left: Saluran Pengaduan Terpadu -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-7 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm space-y-6">
          <div class="border-b border-slate-200 pb-4">
            <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-900 font-bold block">Saluran Resmi Desa</span>
            <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-slate-900 mt-1">Salurkan Laporan Anda</h2>
            <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
              Pilih cara penyampaian yang paling mudah bagi Anda (Formulir Google Form atau WhatsApp Langsung ke Petugas Balai Desa).
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Channel 1: Google Form Resmi -->
          <div class="p-6 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl bg-rose-50/40 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-4">
            <div class="space-y-1">
              <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-bold border border-rose-300 bg-rose-100 text-rose-900">
                Resmi & Lampiran Foto
              </span>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-lg sm:text-xl pt-1">Formulir Pengaduan Online</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Sangat cocok untuk laporan yang disertai foto bukti kejadian atau dokumen.</p>
            </div>
            <a
              href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSc_PLACEHOLDER_ADUAN/viewform"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="shrink-0 min-h-[48px] px-6 py-3 bg-rose-800 hover:bg-rose-900 text-white text-sm sm:text-base font-bold rounded-xl transition-all shadow-sm flex items-center justify-center gap-2"
            >
              <span>Isi Form Aduan</span>
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"/></svg>
            </a>
          </div>

          <!-- Channel 2: WhatsApp Cepat -->
          <div class="p-6 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl bg-emerald-50/40 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-4">
            <div class="space-y-1">
              <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-bold border border-emerald-300 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-950">
                Respon Cepat
              </span>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-lg sm:text-xl pt-1">WhatsApp Satgas Pelayanan</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Terhubung langsung dengan nomor petugas pelayanan Balai Desa Timpik.</p>
            </div>
            <a
              id="aduan-wa-link"
              href="https://wa.me/6281234567890?text=Halo%20Admin%20Desa%20Timpik,%20saya%20ingin%20menyampaikan%20laporan/pengaduan"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="shrink-0 min-h-[48px] px-6 py-3 bg-emerald-700 hover:bg-emerald-800 text-white text-sm sm:text-base font-bold rounded-xl transition-all shadow-sm flex items-center justify-center gap-2"
            >
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 fill-current shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12.04 2c-5.46 0-9.91 4.45-9.91 9.91 0 1.75.46 3.45 1.32 4.95L2.05 22l5.25-1.38c1.45.79 3.08 1.21 4.74 1.21 5.46 0 9.91-4.45 9.91-9.91 0-5.46-4.45-9.92-9.91-9.92z"/></svg>
              <span>Kirim via WA</span>
            </a>
          </div>

          <!-- Kategori Laporan yang Dilayani -->
          <div class="pt-4 border-t border-slate-200">
            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-base mb-3">Bidang Laporan yang Sering Diajukan:</h4>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-sm">
              <div class="p-4 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl">
                <strong class="text-slate-900 block mb-1">Irigasi Sawah & Pertanian:</strong>
                <span class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Kerusakan pintu air saluran irigasi sawah atau pendangkalan parit.</span>
              </div>
              <div class="p-4 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl">
                <strong class="text-slate-900 block mb-1">Penerangan & Jalan Dusun:</strong>
                <span class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Lampu jalan umum mati atau jalan berlubang antar dusun.</span>
              </div>
              <div class="p-4 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl">
                <strong class="text-slate-900 block mb-1">Ketertiban & Fasilitas Umum:</strong>
                <span class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Pemberitahuan acara warga, keamanan lingkungan, dan fasilitas umum.</span>
              </div>
              <div class="p-4 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl">
                <strong class="text-slate-900 block mb-1">Bansos & Lansia Rentan:</strong>
                <span class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Usulan warga lanjut usia atau keluarga rentan yang memerlukan pendataan bantuan.</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right: Komitmen & Standar Pelayanan -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-6">
          <div class="border border-blue-900 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-950 to-indigo-950 text-white p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm space-y-4">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-xl text-amber-400">4 Standar Penanganan Aduan</h3>
            <ul class="space-y-4 text-sm text-blue-100 font-sans">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="text-amber-400 font-extrabold text-base">01.</span>
                <span><strong class="text-white">Kerahasiaan Identitas:</strong> Data pribadi pelapor dilindungi kerahasiaannya.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="text-amber-400 font-extrabold text-base">02.</span>
                <span><strong class="text-white">Respon Cepat 1x24 Jam:</strong> Laporan yang masuk langsung diverifikasi perangkat tugas.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="text-amber-400 font-extrabold text-base">03.</span>
                <span><strong class="text-white">Musyawarah Solutif:</strong> Persoalan infrastruktur dibawa ke rembuk Kadus/RT/RW.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="text-amber-400 font-extrabold text-base">04.</span>
                <span><strong class="text-white">Tindak Lanjut Nyata:</strong> Hasil penyelesaian dilaporkan secara transparan.</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm space-y-3">
            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-base">Butuh Pengurusan Surat Resmi?</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-sans">
              Jika Anda ingin mengajukan surat izin usaha (SKU), surat pengantar SKCK, atau surat keterangan domisili, silakan langsung menuju portal layanan surat.
            </p>
            <a
              href="/layanan-surat"
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 min-h-[44px] px-4 py-2.5 bg-blue-50 text-blue-950 hover:bg-blue-100 text-sm font-bold rounded-xl transition-colors"
            >
              <span>Katalog Layanan Surat &rarr;</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <script>
    try {
      const storedKontak = localStorage.getItem('timpik_kontak_data');
      if (storedKontak) {
        const parsed = JSON.parse(storedKontak);
        if (parsed && parsed.operasional && parsed.operasional.telepon) {
          const cleanWa = parsed.operasional.telepon.replace(/[^0-9]/g, '');
          const aduanLink = document.getElementById('aduan-wa-link') as HTMLAnchorElement | null;
          if (aduanLink && cleanWa) {
            aduanLink.href = `https://wa.me/${cleanWa}?text=Halo%20Admin%20Desa%20Timpik,%20saya%20ingin%20menyampaikan%20laporan/pengaduan`;
          }
        }
      }
    } catch (e) {
      console.warn('Gagal hidrasi WA aduan:', e);
    }
  </script>
</Layout>
